OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FEarly
OL,6,Fevening showers soon dying out in the
OL,7,Fextreme east and northeast of the UK,
OL,8,Fthen generally dry overnight with
OL,9,Fclear spells and lighter winds. Patchy
OL,10,Ffog and some rural grass frost
OL,11,Fpossible. Rain arriving in the far
OL,12,Fnorthwest later.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FWet and windy weather will
OL,15,Fmove in across the west and northwest
OL,16,Fof Scotland and west of Northern
OL,17,FIreland tomorrow. Mostly fine
OL,18,Felsewhere. Some warm sunshine,
OL,19,Fespecially in the southeast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
